        'M32 5c6 9 10 16 8 24 5-3 9-9 9-15 8 9 10 19 6 28-4 11-12 17-23 17C18 59 9 49 9 36c0-8 4-15 10-21-1 7 1 12 5 16-1-9 3-17 8-26Z',
